Act V: കണക്കിന്റെ പ്രധാന ഘട്ടം.

Scene I: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Lear and Ariel]
Lear: Are you as good as Portia?
Ariel: If so, let us proceed to scene IV.

Scene II: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Lear and Ariel]
Lear: Are you as good as Viola?
Ariel: If so, let us proceed to scene V.

Scene III: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Macbeth and Prospero]
Macbeth: You are as good as myself.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Lady Macbeth and Horatio]
Lady Macbeth: You are as good as myself. Let us proceed to act VI.

Scene IV: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Hamlet and Prospero]
Hamlet: You are as good as myself.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Juliet and Horatio]
Juliet: You are as good as myself. Let us proceed to act VI.

Scene V: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Exeunt]
